            <li><a href="#cost">What Does a Cracked Deck Cost to Fix?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#warranty">Is a Cracked Deck Covered by Warranty?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#repair-or-replace">Repair or Replace the Treadmill?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#prevention">How Do You Stop the Next Deck Cracking?</a></li>
